## Tested versions\n\n- Not reproducible in v4.4.1.stable.official [49a5bc7b6]\n- Reproducible in v4.5.beta3.official [4d1f26e1f]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.5.beta3 - Windows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce GTX 980 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6109) - 13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-13700K (24 threads) - 63.74 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen running my project: if I modify my scene and then quit the editor I am not prompted to save my scene and the changes that I've made to my scene are lost.\n\nIt's possible this is related to #95392 and/or #106187\n\nIn Godot 4.4.1 this does not happen because instead of being asked if I want to stop the running project and quit, I'm instead asked if I want to save my modified scene before quitting.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run a project that has a main scene\n2. Modify something in the main scene while the project is running\n3. Quit the editor by choosing Scene - Quit or clicking the close button the editor window\n4. Choose \"Stop & Quit\"\n5. Note that there is no prompt to save the modified scene and the editor quits\n6. Reopen the project to find that changes to the scene have been lost.\n\n\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nAny project will do, but here's a project with a mesh ready to move around for testing:\n\n[stop-and-quit-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21147663/stop-and-quit-bug.zip)\n\n### Expected behaviour\n\nI think the expected behaviour is that after tapping \"Stop & Quit\", the old 4.4.1 \"Save before closing?\" dialog would appear, at which point the user can choose to save their modified scene.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108448/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108448/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}